---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | SocioTool" description="Privacy-first unit economics. Learn how SocioTool protects your data with client-side calculations.">
  <main class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20 overflow-x-hidden">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 tracking-tight transition-colors">Privacy Policy</h1>
    
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      At SocioTool, we believe your financial data belongs to you. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our suite of calculators and tools.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">1. Client-Side Calculations</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      SocioTool is engineered with a strict privacy-first architecture. All of our 47+ calculation formulas execute purely client-side within your own web browser. We do not transmit, harvest, or store the financial variables (such as revenue, COGS, or ad spend) that you input into our calculators on our backend servers.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">2. Analytics and Cookies</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      To understand how our tools are used and to improve the overall user experience, we utilize standard, anonymized web analytics (such as Google Analytics). These tools use cookies to collect non-personally identifiable information, including your IP address, browser type, device information, and pages visited.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">3. Third-Party Advertising</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      Our platform may utilize third-party advertising partners to display relevant ads, keeping SocioTool free for all users. These partners may use cookies and similar tracking technologies to serve advertisements based on your prior visits to our site or other websites on the internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting the respective ad network's consumer choice settings.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">4. Data Control and Rights</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      Because we do not store your financial inputs, there is no personal financial data for us to delete upon request. However, you can control cookie settings natively through your web browser. If you have questions regarding data compliance, you may contact our support team.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4 transition-colors">5. Policy Updates</h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 transition-colors">
      We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time to reflect changes in our operational or legal practices. Your continued use of SocioTool signifies your acceptance of these terms.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
